  <wpt lat="36.150000" lon="-121.650000">
    <ele>96.0</ele>
    <name>275km HAZARD Big Sur - no cell signal, no bike shop, no exit</name>
    <desc>From Carmel to Cambria there is no bike shop, no hospital, no transit and long stretches with no cell signal. A destroyed rear wheel here is a hitch-hike, not a phone call. Carry: 2 tubes, patches, a boot, a spare quick-link, a derailleur hanger, and enough water for 60 km.</desc>
    <sym>Danger Area</sym>
    <type>hazard</type>
  </wpt>
  <wpt lat="36.077032" lon="-121.591787">
    <ele>32.0</ele>
